@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000/api/v1

### ============================================================
### DAY 10 — STEP 10.4.4 — ADMIN AFFILIATE PRODUCT CONTROLLER
### ============================================================


###

### 1. List Affiliate Products

GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/affiliate-products?per_page=5&page=1
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Show Affiliate Product

GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/affiliate-products/1
Accept: application/json

###

### 3. Create Affiliate Product

POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/affiliate-products
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "brand_id": 1,
  "affiliate_network_id": 1,
  "category_id": 1,
  "name": "Cursor AI Pro",
  "affiliate_url": "https://example.com/cursor-pro",
  "website_url": "https://cursor.com",
  "price": 20,
  "currency": "USD",
  "rating": 5,
  "free_trial": true
}

###

### 4. Update Affiliate Product

PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/affiliate-products/1
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "ChatGPT Plus Updated",
  "price": 25,
  "rating": 5
}

###

### 5. Delete Affiliate Product

DELETE {{baseUrl}}/admin/affiliate-products/3
Accept: application/json